WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.020
Sign: Younger Sister Type

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:03.710
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:05.950
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:07.270
Wow, amazing!

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:09.080
It's Yamato Maihime!

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:11.520
They make an exquisite pair!

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:13.920
But something's leering at us!

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:15.420
I don't like this one bit.

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:18.260
Don't worry, Utau-chan is coming to help us!

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:20.560
Yaya and Amu-chan are all gonna be great, too!

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:23.460
So let's just blast all these yucky feelings away!

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:24.530
Doki!

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:43.180
If you were to walk so the wind fluttered the edge of your cape,

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:49.570
people would look up at you in quiet admiration.

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:56.870
You can say spicy things like "it's not my style," if you want,

00:00:56.870 --> 00:01:03.290
but I know who you really are because I'm your friend!

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:05.160
Stand! Bow!

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:06.690
Nice and orderly now!

00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:10.530
And once that's done,

00:01:10.530 --> 00:01:15.800
it's time to start the school day.

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:23.420
I like Mondays because I can see all my friends.

00:01:23.420 --> 00:01:29.820
There's nothing wrong with being abnormally happy.

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:36.990
At lunch break, we have tea in the Royal Garden,

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:44.330
where I tell you all my secrets!

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:59.970
Episode 99
Our Feelings, United! The Guardians' Battle!

00:02:02.330 --> 00:02:05.250
I've been running away.

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:08.850
From the fact that I wasn't able to dance like a girl.

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:11.360
But...

00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:14.780
There's no reason to act like a girl!

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:18.400
The dance that only I can do...

00:02:21.190 --> 00:02:22.530
I'm sure it's out there!

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:31.000
My heart: Unlock!

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:47.240
Character Transformation: Yamato Maihime!

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:01.490
It brings me joy to introduce this side of me to you today.

00:03:02.220 --> 00:03:05.280
You're the previous Queen, Nadeshiko, right?

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:06.950
Correct.

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:08.580
Nadeshiko...

00:03:09.610 --> 00:03:11.920
No, I mean, Nagihiko.

00:03:12.680 --> 00:03:14.820
At last we meet again.

00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:19.180
I'm sorry for making you wait so long, Temari.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:24.220
Come now, let us dance to our heart's content!

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:25.800
Yes!

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:50.200
They're stunning...

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:54.940
You go, Temari!

00:03:55.700 --> 00:03:57.150
There are more of them!

00:03:58.150 --> 00:03:59.310
Nagihiko!

00:03:59.310 --> 00:04:00.050
Right.

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:01.450
What are we going to do?

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:03.350
There's no end to them!

00:04:03.350 --> 00:04:05.750
If Amu were here, she could purify them...

00:04:05.750 --> 00:04:06.830
Rima-chan.

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:10.430
Let's combine our powers.

00:04:20.220 --> 00:04:23.200
Just follow my rhythm.

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:34.610
Charming!

00:04:34.610 --> 00:04:36.000
Beautiful!

00:04:36.850 --> 00:04:38.840
Queen's Waltz!

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:46.930
Amu-chan!

00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:49.930
What's that?

00:04:50.360 --> 00:04:53.120
The X Eggs are being purified...

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:55.460
...by Rima and Nagi!

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:04.610
We have to do our part, too.

00:05:05.410 --> 00:05:06.450
Yeah!

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:16.660
We did it!

00:05:16.660 --> 00:05:18.090
We purified the X Eggs!

00:05:18.090 --> 00:05:19.110
Indeed!

00:05:19.110 --> 00:05:21.190
You guys rock!

00:05:22.290 --> 00:05:26.320
Hey. Why're you still in Nadeshiko-mode?

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:27.820
No particular reason.

00:05:27.820 --> 00:05:30.760
I'm still me regardless, so don't worry about it.

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:43.970
Goodness, look at all those X Eggs.

00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:47.400
They're being drawn to the sound of the violin.

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:51.120
I can hear Ikuto playing the violin.

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:54.760
But the notes sound so pained...

00:05:58.590 --> 00:06:00.040
What's the matter?

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:02.600
The performance has just begun!

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:05.300
And you call yourself the son of a violinist.

00:06:11.860 --> 00:06:14.920
To think you'd be weakened by playing a silly instrument.

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:16.270
Director!

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:19.780
The Guardians have infiltrated the tower.

00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:23.130
I trust the next attraction is ready and waiting for them.

00:06:23.130 --> 00:06:24.740
Yes...

00:06:24.740 --> 00:06:27.950
Don't think you'll get past this so easily.

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:31.950
The one to decide when you take the stage

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:33.930
will be me!

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:51.180
What was that?

00:06:57.510 --> 00:06:59.370
What is that thing?

00:06:59.370 --> 00:07:01.240
It's a wolf, a wolf!

00:07:01.240 --> 00:07:02.900
It smells like X Eggs!

00:07:03.210 --> 00:07:04.360
It does?

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:14.240
Be careful. It's watching our every move.

00:07:18.060 --> 00:07:19.130
Here it comes!

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:40.580
Crazy! That's the biggest dog I've ever seen!

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:42.350
Su!

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:47.040
Mister Doggy, please stop making that scary face!

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:48.910
Calm down, so we can tal-

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:53.320
Oh dear, he doesn't want to listen.

00:07:56.490 --> 00:08:00.330
An artificial monster created by an infusion of X Egg energy.

00:08:00.630 --> 00:08:03.280
Please do enjoy yourselves to the fullest.

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:07.150
If we want to go on, we'll have to fight it.

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:07.760
Yeah.

00:08:07.760 --> 00:08:09.470
Whoa there, hold up.

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:13.880
My heart: Unlock!

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:30.790
Character Transformation: Dear Baby!

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:39.060
Amu-chi, Tadase, just leave this to me!

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:41.660
Believe in me!

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:45.110
Yaya, um, what are you doing?

00:08:45.110 --> 00:08:47.330
What's gotten in to you, Yuiki-san?

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:51.420
That's <i>so</i> not the way you reacted to Rima-tan!

00:08:51.740 --> 00:08:55.520
You people are completely underestimating the Yaya.

00:08:55.520 --> 00:08:59.350
But I'll show you right here and now what makes me so amazing!

00:08:59.650 --> 00:09:01.330
New special finishing move:

00:09:01.330 --> 00:09:04.100
Little Duckies Dash!

00:09:12.530 --> 00:09:13.780
Little Duckies?

00:09:18.860 --> 00:09:21.200
Okay, forget it, I'm scared!

00:09:21.500 --> 00:09:22.930
Yaya, stand back!

00:09:22.930 --> 00:09:25.000
We'll handle this!

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:29.420
My heart:

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:30.630
My heart:

00:09:30.940 --> 00:09:32.340
Unlock!

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:47.140
Character Transformation: Platinum Royal!

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:52.060
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:57.530
Sorry, but we're gettin' through here!

00:09:57.880 --> 00:10:01.330
Spiral Heart Special!

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:14.340
Holy Crown!

00:10:17.790 --> 00:10:19.130
Tadase-kun!

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:21.130
Are you okay, Amu-chan?

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:21.960
Yeah.

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:30.020
It's so strong!

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:32.590
Amu-chi! Tadase!

00:10:32.590 --> 00:10:34.030
Don't come over here!

00:10:34.030 --> 00:10:35.360
Stay back!

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:03.720
Yaya?

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:07.000
I really want to be a baby forever.

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:09.200
I wish I could stay the baby of the family.

00:11:09.820 --> 00:11:12.220
I like it when everyone protects me.

00:11:12.220 --> 00:11:14.640
When they let me rely on them.

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:17.660
When they fawn over me.

00:11:17.660 --> 00:11:22.610
I've never been strong. That's just me!

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:25.170
But!

00:11:25.170 --> 00:11:29.370
There are times when the baby's gotta step up to the plate!

00:11:31.090 --> 00:11:33.920
Watch this, you two!

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:35.540
Special attack:

00:11:36.720 --> 00:11:40.470
Merry Merry Double Block!

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:46.020
Well, there's definitely two of them...

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:49.110
But the name sounds like a type of diaper.

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:56.350
It's playing with them.

00:11:56.350 --> 00:11:58.690
I guess its doggy instincts took over.

00:11:58.990 --> 00:12:01.250
Okay, now's my chance!

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:09.910
Little Duckies Scrum! Go! Go!

00:12:14.270 --> 00:12:17.360
Now's your chance, guys! Go!

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:18.920
But Yaya...

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:22.300
I'll be fine! Babies are invincible!

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:24.020
Yuiki-san...

00:12:28.030 --> 00:12:29.730
What are you standing around for?

00:12:29.730 --> 00:12:33.500
Don't let the baby of the family's hard work go to waste!

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:34.820
Utau!

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:37.310
Sorry to keep you waiting,

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:39.130
but your backup has arrived.

00:12:48.070 --> 00:12:50.240
Utau? Why are you guys here?

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:53.140
What kind of question is that?

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:56.970
I entrusted you with Ikuto, but you obviously weren't up to the challenge.

00:12:56.970 --> 00:12:58.600
What she said.

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:05.630
Aren't you working hard.

00:13:06.460 --> 00:13:08.600
Utau-chan? Why are you...

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:13.520
I know a few things about being the youngest sibling.

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:15.350
I am a younger sister type, after all.

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:17.600
Younger sister type?

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:19.980
Well sure, she's technically the little sister, but...

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:20.940
What are you implying?

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:21.990
Nothing...

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:25.260
You were pretty impressive.

00:13:25.260 --> 00:13:28.070
These days, kid sisters need to be tough, don't you agree?

00:13:29.590 --> 00:13:30.940
Watch this.

00:13:30.940 --> 00:13:34.000
White Wing!

00:13:39.110 --> 00:13:41.870
Wow! Awesome, Utau!

00:13:41.870 --> 00:13:45.440
Don't just stand there with your mouths hanging open, get moving!

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:46.880
Utau-chan...

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:51.680
Tadase, you're a man, so you better protect Amu.

00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:56.480
And Amu... I'm counting on you, too.

00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:59.980
Because I believe in you.

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:08.200
Thank you, Utau, Yaya!

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:14.370
They finally left.

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:15.540
Now then...

00:14:18.940 --> 00:14:23.110
It's time to punish that naughty troublemaker.

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:25.890
She's an idol all right!

00:14:25.890 --> 00:14:27.770
That look means business!

00:14:27.770 --> 00:14:30.470
Look? If you ask me, that's a glare...

00:14:30.770 --> 00:14:32.570
Come on, lemme at 'em!

00:14:32.570 --> 00:14:33.940
El, switch out!

00:14:33.940 --> 00:14:35.470
Roger that!

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:49.390
Character Transformation: Lunatic Charm!

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:52.160
Nightmare Lorelei!

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:03.900
Ooh! That little devil outfit is mega cute!

00:15:03.900 --> 00:15:05.670
Let's do that, too!

00:15:05.970 --> 00:15:09.770
Sexy and cute! Transform!

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:13.350
Little Duckies Black! Go! Go!

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:20.660
All right!

00:15:20.660 --> 00:15:22.580
We made doggy swoon!!

00:15:22.580 --> 00:15:25.380
Guess little devils are his type.

00:15:25.380 --> 00:15:28.030
You're doing better than I expected.

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:31.870
Kukai made you sound a lot more spoiled.

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:37.310
Utau-chan, now's your chance.

00:15:37.310 --> 00:15:37.910
Right.

00:15:39.030 --> 00:15:41.490
Angel Cradle!

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:09.990
Hoshina Utau's purification has ruined the attraction.

00:16:09.990 --> 00:16:12.560
Also, the Embryo did not appear.

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:18.300
It may be safe to assume the Embryo won't come when so few X Eggs are purified.

00:16:21.560 --> 00:16:23.610
That tickles!

00:16:23.610 --> 00:16:26.540
I can't believe how adorable he actually is!

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:28.000
I guess everything's all right here.

00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:30.020
But up ahead...

00:16:30.020 --> 00:16:31.010
Yeah...

00:16:43.290 --> 00:16:44.890
We're almost to the roof.

00:16:44.890 --> 00:16:45.890
Good!

00:17:01.930 --> 00:17:05.870
Everyone's worked so hard to get us this far...

00:17:06.410 --> 00:17:10.920
So I'm going to rescue Ikuto!

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:22.950
Ikuto-niisan...

00:17:22.950 --> 00:17:24.310
Ikuto!

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:33.730
He's white as a ghost-nya!

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:46.180
It's about time.

00:17:47.010 --> 00:17:49.350
At last the Embryo will be...

00:17:49.350 --> 00:17:50.820
...in my grasp.

00:17:56.180 --> 00:17:58.360
Excellent timing.

00:17:58.360 --> 00:17:59.580
Guardians!

00:17:59.580 --> 00:18:04.440
I trust you'll enjoy the main attraction!

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:16.180
Holy Crown!

00:18:24.610 --> 00:18:27.870
There's something off about that attack...

00:18:33.940 --> 00:18:37.130
Dark Night Storm!

00:18:45.800 --> 00:18:46.810
Amu-chan!

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:50.600
I can't... move.

00:18:51.700 --> 00:18:53.480
Tadase, watch yourself!

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:57.610
If you touch that shock wave, dark energy will eat away at you!

00:19:04.820 --> 00:19:06.580
Ikuto-niisan!

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:11.770
I know you're weak, hurt, and being controlled!

00:19:11.770 --> 00:19:17.230
But if you even try to hurt her, I will fight you!

00:19:23.820 --> 00:19:26.570
With this Royal Sword!

00:19:28.430 --> 00:19:30.130
Tadase-kun!

00:19:31.510 --> 00:19:34.980
Dark Night Storm!

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:38.060
Holy Saber!

00:19:55.060 --> 00:20:00.100
Why... Why do they have to fight?

00:20:00.100 --> 00:20:03.300
I guess because they're boys...

00:20:05.160 --> 00:20:09.640
Ikuto's never wanted to involve the people he cares about.

00:20:09.940 --> 00:20:13.600
And Tadase-kun wants to protect those dear to him, too.

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:18.110
And so, even though neither of them wanted this...

00:20:23.790 --> 00:20:25.890
It's so sad.

00:20:25.890 --> 00:20:29.460
They don't hate each other at all.

00:20:30.640 --> 00:20:34.020
Yes, good! Be a "man!"

00:20:34.020 --> 00:20:37.880
As the chaos inside Ikuto increases, so does the dark energy he creates!

00:20:38.180 --> 00:20:43.810
And that's exactly where you come in, Hinamori Amu.

00:20:43.810 --> 00:20:48.570
The Embryo will appear when you purify a great number of X Eggs.

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:03.890
The Dumpty Key!

00:21:11.890 --> 00:21:13.430
That boy...

00:21:15.770 --> 00:21:17.620
Is he crying?

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:28.600
This... just isn't right.

00:21:29.880 --> 00:21:34.270
I don't understand why they're fighting if they don't want to.

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:37.900
Is it because I'm a girl?

00:21:38.770 --> 00:21:45.790
But even so... There must be a way for me to fight, too.

00:21:46.900 --> 00:21:50.800
Dumpty Key! Humpty Lock!

00:21:50.800 --> 00:21:53.010
Lend me your power!

00:22:27.870 --> 00:22:33.220
You sure do seem determined.

00:22:34.630 --> 00:22:39.270
So even if you screw up, it'll somehow turn out all right.

00:22:39.970 --> 00:22:46.640
How about you just trust in yourself?

00:22:46.920 --> 00:22:53.100
Take that first step and everything will work out fine.

00:22:53.710 --> 00:23:00.030
Even if people see through your cool exterior, keep marching on.

00:23:00.450 --> 00:23:09.110
Look up at the blue sky and everything will reset!

00:23:09.690 --> 00:23:12.750
Take it easy! Take it easy!

00:23:13.030 --> 00:23:23.290
Try to relax those shoulders and clear your mind.

00:23:23.290 --> 00:23:30.000
The more you do it, the easier it'll get, so keep taking it easy.

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:35.200
Ride the flow of time and you'll be...

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:39.000
Shining! Shining! Shining!

00:23:50.320 --> 00:23:51.630
It's about time!

00:23:51.630 --> 00:23:53.070
The key's in the lock!

00:23:53.420 --> 00:23:55.300
Yes, it's been unlocked!

00:23:55.300 --> 00:23:58.570
And Ikuto's past is floating on that brilliant light!

00:23:58.570 --> 00:24:00.450
So that's Ikuto when he was younger!

00:24:00.450 --> 00:24:01.940
And Tsukasa-san!

00:24:01.940 --> 00:24:05.000
The reason for tears flowing in far away countries!

00:24:05.000 --> 00:24:08.460
Will Ikuto finally be set free?

00:24:08.460 --> 00:24:10.160
Don't miss it!

00:24:10.160 --> 00:24:12.200
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:12.200 --> 00:24:14.300
The Birth of Two Character Transformations!

00:24:14.300 --> 00:24:15.990
Two Character Transformations?

00:24:15.990 --> 00:24:17.210
You mean Ikuto and...

00:24:17.210 --> 00:24:18.170
...Amu-chan?

00:24:18.170 --> 00:24:19.470
Huh? Me?!
